artifacts:
  - $route/4.3.scenario.elimination.assay.plan.yield.md

reviews:
  self:
    - slug: has-result-elimination-map
      say: |
        does each test carry a result -> elimination map (which scenarios each
        outcome drops)? a test with no such map cannot collapse the superposition.
    - slug: has-irreducible-set
      say: |
        is the set of scenarios that stay live if every test is inconclusive named
        explicitly? that irreducible set is what the treatment plan must cover.
